---
id: 5b1d7c2e-3f4a-4e8b-9c6d-1a2b3c4d5e6f
name: Registry end-to-end
---

A filter, an RMS, an integration and per-lap reductions over
`synth-3lap.idl0`, evaluated by `idl-rs workbook eval --values` in
`cli/src/verbs/workbook.rs`; the values are `registry-e2e.expected.txt`.

```math id=a1b2c3d4
fork = butter(2, 2, "low", [IMU0_AccelZ])
fork_rms = rms([fork])
speed = cumulative_trapezoid([IMU0_AccelZ])
speed_end = last([speed])
lap_s = lap_time()
fastest_s = min(lap_time())
```
